# Top-level API dependencies (CR-034).
#
#   requirements.in   this file — human-edited version ranges, the intent
#   requirements.txt  generated, fully pinned lock with SHA-256 hashes
#
# Regenerate the lock with `scripts/lock-requirements.sh` (pip-tools on
# Python 3.12 / linux, the same interpreter CI and the image use) and commit it.
# Installs use the lock, which pip puts in hash-checking mode automatically:
#
#   pip install -r requirements.txt && pip install --no-deps -e ../engine
#
# The engine is a local editable package, so it cannot appear in a hashed lock;
# install it separately with --no-deps. Its own pins must agree with this file
# and are enforced by tests/test_solver_pins.py.

